# Public build-time Worker origin; NEVER place secrets in VITE_ variables.
# Development uses http://localhost:8787 when empty.
# Production Pages project: power-elec-site.
# Production must use https://power-api.power-elec.workers.dev (no /api).
# An isolated Preview API requires an explicit build: npm run build -- --mode preview
# A production build intentionally fails until VITE_API_URL is configured.
VITE_API_URL=
